# Phase — Project Intelligence

## Product
RSI regime EA: visual + live bounce trades (v1.45).

## Regime (v1.29 freeze / ignite-once)
- OnInit: ONE 500-bar walk (ignite) → freeze `g_regimes` + keep `g_walk`
- New bar: `PhRegimeAdvance` only — never rebuild past colours
- Stick until INV/S&R leave rules fire (Buy/Sell Process)
- Resist = highest swing >=70 & <80 (never below 70; not on 80)
- Support = lowest swing <=25 & >20 (never above 25; not on 20)
- S&R line: regime enter → regime END
- No INV → leave stay >65 (sell) / <35 (buy)

## Trade (v1.45)
- BUY regime: bounce 35–40 / 50; **also** 60–65 pullback then bounce up (≥60) → buy
- SELL regime: bounce 60–65 / 50; **also** 35–40 bounce down → sell
- Extra RSI S&R: last 100 bars RSI swing H/L — support **<35** / resist **>65** only; scan even if RSI window missing (draw optional); arm on touch → fire on bounce/reject (`Phase_PriceSR.mqh`)
- Every bounce = new entry; lot 0.01; **SL = 2nd FVG only if ≥800 pips** (else min 800); **no fixed TP**
- Regime change → CloseAll + unlock; red Div → close buys; green → close sells
- Live new-bar only; HD does not exit
- Support HD entry: BUY+hidden bull / SELL+hidden bear (`PH_HD`)
- Brown FVG soft reject: BUY=upper from-below reject-down / SELL=lower from-above reject-up → **Unlock + 1× `PH_FVG`** (not CloseAll; skip grey/full-through)
- SL hit → CloseAll + **seq LOCK**
- Unlock: helping HD **or** helping regular Div **or** supporting brown FVG reject
- Modules: `Phase_Trade.mqh`, `Phase_FVG.mqh`; magic `InpTradeMagic`

## FVG / iFVG (v1.45 — cache + SL + chart + reject)
- Detect: C1/C2/C3 wick gap; bull C2 up — `h1<l3` else pierce `h1<l2`; bear mirror `l1>h3` / `l1>h2`; min gap pts default 30
- Brown=open FVG; Grey=iFVG = opposite **through** ≥1; through≥2=gone; close-inside=stays brown
- Chart: `PH_FvgB_/PH_FvgR_`; width **1000** clamp **30–1000**; lookback **800**; maxShow **12**; `InpShowFvg`
- Perf: FVG list cached (rebuild once / incremental new-bar); no full wipe+ObjectsTotal each bar; PriceSR redraw only on level change; Loss history throttle 5s
- Dyn SL: 2nd/3rd side-FVG only if dist ≥ max(800,slPips) via PhTrade_PipSize; else min-pips fallback
- Soft reject trade runs even if `InpShowFvg` false (draw optional)

## Divergence / BOS / HD (v1.39 from Future2EA)
- Regular Div: nearest RSI tops/bottoms; 1st >60/<45; 2nd dead-zone bahar; path clean; nearest draw
- HD: nearest-in-time RSI extrema; 35–65; min ΔRSI; no BOS
- Phase_RSI: levels 20/35/40/50/60/65/80 all white solid
- Live flags: `newRegularBear` / `newRegularBull` on `SPhDivState`

## Drawing
- Prefix `PH_`
- Modules: Buy/Sell/Regime/SR/PriceSR/FVG/Draw/Dash/Div*/Trade + Types
- Dash: top-right M1..H1 regime pills (green/red) — Phase own, not F2E

## Companion
`Indicators/Phase_RSI.mq5` — RSI(14), levels 20/35/40/50/60/65/80

